<h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

<div class="faq">
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>Who can register?</summary>
    <p>Individuals 18 or older who broker or sell commercial financing in the United States, whether as an employee, an independent contractor or self-employed.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>Why should I register?</summary>
    <p>Recognized by industry trade associations, funders and lenders, registration provides a unique number verifying your completion of commercial finance training and assessment, demonstrating your commitment to professionalism and industry standards.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>What information do I need?</summary>
    <p>Your legal name, date of birth, ZIP code, email and mobile number, when you started in the industry, current employer and job title, and the products you represent. We never ask for your Social Security number or home address.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>What does the training involve?</summary>
    <p>Four short modules followed by a 20-question multiple-choice assessment, about 30 minutes in total. You need 80% to pass, and you can save your progress and come back.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>How much does it cost?</summary>
    <p>$99 a year, paid by card after you pass the assessment. Your registration becomes active as soon as payment is complete.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>Does it renew automatically?</summary>
    <p>Yes, every 12 months at $99. We email you 30 days before each renewal, and you can cancel online at any time. You stay registered through the period you've paid for.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>What if I change jobs?</summary>
    <p>Your registration belongs to you, not your employer, and your number stays the same for your whole career. Update your employer from your account at any time, at no cost.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>How do I keep my information current?</summary>
    <p>Update it from your account whenever something changes. We also ask you to review it once a year, before your renewal.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>How is a registration verified?</summary>
    <p>Anyone can enter a registration number on <a href="/verify">Verify a Registration</a> to see the name, status and valid-through date. There is no directory or name search to protect privacy and prevent solicitation.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>Does registration replace a license?</summary>
    <p>No. Broker Registry is a private and independent registry for individuals working in commercial finance. It does not replace any license or registration required by law and does not authorize anyone to perform activities that require a state license.</p>
  </details>
</div>

<div class="actions">
  <a class="button" href="/portal/signup">Register</a>
  <a class="button secondary" href="/support">Ask a Question</a>
</div>
